::'''Firefly:''' ...Thank you.
::I want to know the truth. Is that too much to ask?
::'''Firefly:''' ...Sure.
::You feel guilty, don't you?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I want to know the truth. Is that too much to ask?
::'''Firefly:''' ...Sure.
::You feel guilty, don't you?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You feel guilty, don't you?
:'''Firefly:''' ...Yes.
:'''Firefly:''' There are things... I'm hiding from you...
